#. de: Confiteor
#. fr: Confiteor préparé
#. column 1: Able to execute <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Confiteor</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
msgctxt "Status:3019:0:0"
msgid "Confiteor Ready"
msgstr "Готовность к конфитеору"

#. ja: コンフィテオルを実行できる状態。
#. de: <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Confiteor</ui-edge-color></ui-color> kann ausgeführt werden.
#. fr: Confiteor peut être lancé.
#. column 0: Confiteor Ready
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
