#. de: Erlittener Schaden ist verringert und Immunität gegen alle Statuseffekte, die von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Purifikation</ui-edge-color></ui-color> aufgehoben werden können, sowie Rückstoß- und Heranzieheffekte. Be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>ge<shy>schwin<shy>dig<shy>keit ist verringert.
#. fr: Les dégâts reçus ainsi que la vitesse de déplacement sont réduits. Insensible aux altérations d'état soignables avec Dépuration, aux projections et aux attractions.
#. column 0: Guard
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:3054:0:1"
msgid "Damage taken is reduced. All <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stun</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Heavy</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Bind</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Silence</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Half-asleep</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Sleep</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Deep Freeze</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, knockback, and draw-in effects are nullified. Movement speed is reduced."
msgstr "Получаемый урон снижен. Вы невосприимчивы к <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Оглушению</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Тяжести</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Связыванию</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Молчанию</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Дрёме</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Сну</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Глубокой заморозке</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, отбрасыванию и притягиванию. Скорость передвижения снижена."

