#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:3812:0:1"
msgid "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hasty Touch</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is upgraded to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Daring Touch</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "Умение «<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Быстрая обработка</ui-edge-color></ui-color>» превращается в «<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Отважную обработку</ui-edge-color></ui-color>»."

#. ja: 匠の絶技
#. de: Meisters Beitrag
#. fr: Main suprême
#. column 1: Durability loss of next action is reduced to zero.
msgctxt "Status:3813:0:0"
msgid "Trained Perfection"
msgstr "Совершенство мастера"

#. ja: 一度だけ、耐久の消費が無効化される状態。
#. de: Das nächste Kommando kostet keine Belastbarkeit.
#. fr: Le prochain coût en solidité dû à une action est réduit à 0.
#. column 0: Trained Perfection
msgctxt "Status:3813:0:1"
msgid "Durability loss of next action is reduced to zero."
msgstr "Следующее действие не расходует прочность."

#. ja: 重力異常
#. de: Gravitationsanomalie
#. fr: Anomalie gravitationnelle
#. column 1: Hovering above the ground due to a disturbance in gravity. Unable to execute Jump.
msgctxt "Status:3814:0:0"
msgid "Gravitational Anomaly"
msgstr "Гравитационная аномалия"

#. ja: 重力の乱れにより宙に浮き、ジャンプが実行不可となった状態。
#. de: Schwebt einige Ilme über dem Boden und kann nicht springen.
#. fr: Le corps flotte en raison de variations dans la gravité. L'utilisation du saut est impossible.
#. column 0: Gravitational Anomaly
msgctxt "Status:3814:0:1"
msgid "Hovering above the ground due to a disturbance in gravity. Unable to execute Jump."
msgstr "Вы парите над землёй из-за сбоя гравитации и не можете использовать умение «Прыжок»."

