msgctxt "Status:3984:0:1"
msgid "Healing magic potency is increased."
msgstr "Сила исцеляющей магии увеличена."

#. ja: テンパランス：効果
#. de: Linderung
#. fr: Tempérance
#. column 1: Damage taken is reduced.
