#. fr: Insensible à un certain montant de dégâts.
#. column 0: Neutral Sect
msgctxt "Status:3988:0:1"
msgid "A magicked barrier is nullifying damage."
msgstr "Магический барьер поглощает урон."

#. ja: マクロコスモス
#. de: Makrokosmos
#. fr: Macrocosme
#. column 1: Restores HP when the astrologian who granted this effect executes <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Microcosmos</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
msgctxt "Status:3989:0:0"
msgid "Macrocosmos"
msgstr "Макрокосмос"

#. ja: 自身にこのステータスを付与した占星術師が「ミクロコスモス」を実行することで、自身のＨＰを回復させる効果が発動する状態。
#. de: Wenn der Verursacher des Status <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Mikrokosmos</ui-edge-color></ui-color> ausführt, werden eigene LP regeneriert.
#. fr: Des PV sont récupérés quand l'astromancien à l'origine de celui-ci utilise Microcosme.
#. column 0: Macrocosmos
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:3989:0:1"
